      <p>By Jono Sison</p></div></div></li><li class="flex rounded-md shadow-sm"><div class="flex w-16 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-l-md"><a class="flex items-center justify-center" href="/2023/12/12/the-northern-hemisphere-winter-will-officially-begin-on-december-21st" aria-label="The Northern Hemisphere Winter Will Officially Begin On December 21st"><img class="w-full rounded object-cover " data-src="https://cdn4.dogonews.com/images/762e2416-29e2-4dd2-af6c-58c6713cd8ac/1920px-winter_forest_silver.jpeg" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 64 48&quot;%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="The Northern Hemisphere Winter Will Officially Begin On December 21st"></a></div>
